---
description: Nowaki framework repo — conventions for AI edits
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root for full guidance (layout, commands, feature
map). Key invariants for any change:

- `crates/nowaki-core` executes **no JavaScript** — JS interop is the
  `PluginBridge` trait. `NowakiCore::read_source` is the single source-read
  chokepoint.
- Rust unit tests (`#[cfg(test)] mod tests`) go at the **end** of each file
  (clippy `items-after-test-module`).
- Import handling lives in several transform modes (dev browser/SSR, build
  client/server, chunk hoisting) — a change usually touches all of them.
- Relative imports use **explicit extensions** (`../islands/Counter.tsx`).
- **Preact, not React**: `react*` is aliased to `preact/compat`.

Before done: `cargo fmt --all --check && cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings && cargo test --workspace`.
